# Auto-generated documentation mirrors
# Files like build.py -> build.md are generated by the project's documentation mirror tool.
# These clutter git history and cause conflicts. Keep only intentional documentation.
**/*.md
!CHANGELOG.md
!HISTORY.md
!README.md
!CLAUDE.md
!docs/**/*.md
!docs/*.md
!HANDOFF.md
